 EXCLUSIVE DEVELOPMENT 300 METRES FROM THE BEACH | APÚLIA

EXCLUSIVE DREAM HOME IN BARCELOS

We are pleased to present this fantastic residential development, situated in Apúlia, Esposende, just 300 metres from the beach, designed for those seeking quality of life, comfort and modernity in a prime location.

Featuring contemporary architecture and elegant lines, this development comprises 12 two-bedroom flats, designed to offer functionality, natural light and a sense of well-being.

One of the major highlights of this development is its magnificent rooftop with a swimming pool and communal leisure area the ideal space to relax, make the most of sunny days and enjoy special moments with family and friends, with the sea so close by.

Inside, the flats stand out for their high-quality materials and fittings, with particular attention paid to comfort and energy efficiency.

Key features:

- 12 two-bedroom flats;

- Prime location, 300 metres from the beach;

- Block with rooftop, swimming pool and leisure area;

- Kitchens fitted with Bosch appliances;

- Kitchen units with thermolaminate finish and Silestone worktops;

- Ducted air conditioning;

- Individual heat pump for domestic hot water;

- Mechanical ventilation system (VMC);

- Aluminium window frames with thermal break and double glazing;

- Electric blinds;

- Integrated LED lighting;

- Underground parking;

- Electric vehicle charging point;

- Energy class A+.

More than just a flat, this is an opportunity to invest in a lifestyle where the sea, comfort and tranquillity come together.

Whether for your own home, a holiday home or an investment, this development offers features that make all the difference.

Your next seaside retreat could be right here!

